WEBVTT

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:21.030
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:26.770
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:32.580
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:37.480
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:43.320
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:50.000
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.730
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:00.910
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:06.680
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:13.190
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:18.860
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:24.000
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.800
Shine the light!

00:01:32.727 --> 00:01:34.387
"Class A River"
"lkai River"

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:45.377
I thought you might remember it if
I create the same situation as that time.

00:01:45.377 --> 00:01:49.947
The same situation...
I really don't know what you mean.

00:01:49.947 --> 00:01:53.117
If I'm the one you're after,
you can let the children go, right?!

00:01:53.117 --> 00:01:55.247
Oh really...

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:56.587
Oh really!

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:20.977
How about now?!
This is the same, right?!

00:02:20.977 --> 00:02:25.967
The same as the time and place
where your mother killed us, right?!

00:03:05.457 --> 00:03:08.687
So you remember now, Ouri?

00:03:08.687 --> 00:03:13.997
That was... my... mother?

00:03:13.997 --> 00:03:16.467
That's right, Ouri.

00:03:16.467 --> 00:03:17.827
That's right.

00:03:22.707 --> 00:03:24.197
This way.

00:03:26.577 --> 00:03:29.047
So no survivors, huh?

00:03:29.047 --> 00:03:31.477
Senior Mibu, Senior Tagami!

00:03:34.417 --> 00:03:37.987
This kid... is still alive.

00:03:37.987 --> 00:03:40.727
It was more than ten years ago.

00:03:40.727 --> 00:03:45.497
There was an incident where
only small children were kidnapped.

00:03:45.497 --> 00:03:50.837
Those kidnapped children weren't
given water or food so they had all died.

00:03:50.837 --> 00:03:53.107
Then Ouri-kun is...

00:03:53.107 --> 00:03:56.377
A woman nine months
pregnant died in a hit and run

00:03:56.377 --> 00:03:58.777
and became a Shikabane.

00:03:58.777 --> 00:04:01.777
A Shikabane that was going
to be a mother gave birth...

00:04:01.777 --> 00:04:03.777
That child was Ouri.

00:04:03.777 --> 00:04:08.217
A child born of a Shikabane...
Is that child a Shikabane?

00:04:08.217 --> 00:04:14.457
No... That's why the mother
Shikabane couldn't understand Ouri.

00:04:14.457 --> 00:04:18.757
That Shikabane's regret was not
being able to hold her child in her arms.

00:04:18.757 --> 00:04:23.297
The mother abandoned Ouri and
kidnapped babies one after another.

00:04:23.297 --> 00:04:27.467
But no matter how many she kidnapped,
she couldn't find her own baby.

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:30.807
That hellish scene must
have gone on and on.

00:04:30.807 --> 00:04:34.447
And Ouri-kun was watching all that.

00:04:34.447 --> 00:04:38.437
Yes, while surviving
with his amazing vitality...

00:04:46.627 --> 00:04:48.787
Among the babies killed,

00:04:48.787 --> 00:04:51.427
there was just one
who became a Shikabane.

00:04:51.427 --> 00:04:53.917
A baby Shikabane?

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:09.297
"I wanna eat..."

00:05:13.117 --> 00:05:15.107
"I wanna eat..."

00:05:16.787 --> 00:05:19.187
"I wanna eat..."

00:05:19.187 --> 00:05:22.957
After being forced apart
from his mother and killed,

00:05:22.957 --> 00:05:27.187
he came back to life with his only
regret being that he could not eat.

00:05:28.997 --> 00:05:32.967
You are... that Shikabane!

00:05:32.967 --> 00:05:34.507
It wasn't just me.

00:05:34.507 --> 00:05:36.277
Those other kids that were killed

00:05:36.277 --> 00:05:40.347
have also been following you
around as a mass of Shiryou!

00:05:40.347 --> 00:05:43.647
Ouri... Ouri...

00:05:43.647 --> 00:05:46.347
That's right. It's us.

00:05:46.347 --> 00:05:49.957
We were all killed by your mother!

00:05:49.957 --> 00:05:53.687
Why are you, just you, alive?!

00:05:53.687 --> 00:05:55.457
Can you fight?!

00:05:55.457 --> 00:05:58.447
Against us, who were killed in your place?!

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:04.067
You wanted... that body, right?!

00:06:16.817 --> 00:06:19.147
I'm not gonna just kill you.

00:06:20.317 --> 00:06:23.307
I'll give you a taste...

00:06:26.157 --> 00:06:28.987
a taste of the hell I went through!

00:06:30.527 --> 00:06:35.017
That's right! Eat! Eat! I ate, too!

00:06:39.337 --> 00:06:44.167
I ate and ate... my friends who died!

00:06:48.547 --> 00:06:51.617
Why didn't you tell me about it until now?

00:06:51.617 --> 00:06:54.747
That was what Keisei wished.

00:06:54.747 --> 00:07:00.627
At the time, that Shikabane was killed
by three monks, Akasha, Mibu and Tagami.

00:07:00.627 --> 00:07:06.467
Then Senior Tagami petitioned to
spare the life of Ouri-kun who survived...

00:07:06.467 --> 00:07:11.237
saying that he would never allow
Ouri-kun to get involved with the defiled.

00:07:11.237 --> 00:07:13.407
Why did he go that far?

00:07:13.407 --> 00:07:19.567
Because even though it was a Shikabane,
they killed his mother, right?

00:07:21.777 --> 00:07:23.117
Don't move!

00:07:23.117 --> 00:07:25.117
I'm gonna go find Ouri.

00:07:25.117 --> 00:07:28.087
A big operation is currently in progress.

00:07:28.087 --> 00:07:31.747
You two are to help strengthen
the head temple's defenses.

00:08:02.417 --> 00:08:04.077
Why...

00:08:08.927 --> 00:08:11.827
Why can't I defeat you?!

00:08:11.827 --> 00:08:14.967
Enemy... I'm your enemy!

00:08:14.967 --> 00:08:21.207
The regrets that I hold are not just
about destroying the Seven Stars.

00:08:21.207 --> 00:08:23.637
The feelings of Keisei who was killed, too...

00:08:23.637 --> 00:08:27.677
The regrets of two people...
That should be enough!

00:08:27.677 --> 00:08:31.167
I shouldn't lose to any Shikabane!

00:08:42.287 --> 00:08:45.727
I'm your enemy. Your enemy!

00:08:53.907 --> 00:08:58.237
Do you want me to tell you...
the reason you can't win?

00:09:03.747 --> 00:09:07.987
Hokuto of the Seven Stars
has neither regrets nor nature.

00:09:07.987 --> 00:09:10.687
There's no way someone can
become a Shikabane like that!

00:09:10.687 --> 00:09:13.187
Well, it is possible.

00:09:13.187 --> 00:09:20.497
Those who become Shikabane and you,
Shikabane Hime, used to be alive, right?

00:09:21.497 --> 00:09:23.937
Joys and sadness...

00:09:23.937 --> 00:09:25.867
You loved and were loved...

00:09:25.867 --> 00:09:28.207
and sometimes you hated...

00:09:28.207 --> 00:09:32.437
As one of the living, you must have
experienced all of those feelings...

00:09:32.437 --> 00:09:36.077
The chance to live her life
was taken away from Hokuto.

00:09:36.077 --> 00:09:39.077
She was born and raised
as a human sacrifice.

00:09:39.077 --> 00:09:42.277
She was still without
regrets or nature when...

00:09:44.517 --> 00:09:48.287
She was born to die.

00:10:14.947 --> 00:10:19.487
Upon her death, Hokuto
became free for the first time.

00:10:19.487 --> 00:10:23.477
She was able to come in contact
with others and felt their existences.

00:10:31.567 --> 00:10:36.227
Hokuto harms people
not out of regrets or nature.

00:10:38.237 --> 00:10:43.677
Her existence itself is
one that destroys the living.

00:10:51.087 --> 00:10:55.527
Do you understand what she is?

00:10:55.527 --> 00:10:57.497
She is death.

00:10:57.497 --> 00:10:59.327
Death?

00:11:01.497 --> 00:11:05.497
The living unconsciously try to keep it
away from themselves and to forget it.

00:11:05.497 --> 00:11:09.877
However, it certainly exists
and there's no escaping from it.

00:11:09.877 --> 00:11:15.307
Hokuto is an existence
that embodies death itself.

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:18.947
That's exactly why she sits
at the top of Shikabane

00:11:18.947 --> 00:11:23.107
and no one can defeat her.

00:11:28.157 --> 00:11:30.297
Death, you said?

00:11:30.297 --> 00:11:32.057
Such a thing...

00:11:32.057 --> 00:11:36.497
I am happy to know her existence.

00:11:37.497 --> 00:11:43.377
How come I knew...
Hokuto's memories?

00:11:43.377 --> 00:11:45.537
That's just natural.

00:11:45.537 --> 00:11:47.167
What do you mean?

00:11:47.547 --> 00:11:50.477
The family that once managed the
human sacrifice custom in Hokuto's village

00:11:50.477 --> 00:11:54.487
embraced the Kougon Sect later
after coming to know the phenomenon

00:11:54.487 --> 00:11:57.187
where humans become Shikabane.

00:11:57.187 --> 00:12:00.987
The name of that family is Hoshimura.

00:12:01.387 --> 00:12:04.657
Your ancestors created Hokuto.

00:12:04.657 --> 00:12:08.067
She was a daughter of your family.

00:12:08.067 --> 00:12:10.037
You two have the same blood in your veins.

00:12:10.037 --> 00:12:13.367
That's precisely why
Hokuto became your enemy.

00:12:13.367 --> 00:12:17.027
Hokuto was given
a meaning for the first time.

00:12:18.107 --> 00:12:20.947
She's your enemy.

00:12:20.947 --> 00:12:24.777
That is to say, she's become
the enemy of the Kougon Sect.

00:12:24.777 --> 00:12:29.047
Hence, naturally her power will be
used to destroy the Kougon Sect.

00:12:29.047 --> 00:12:32.187
The same blood, you said? Is that why?

00:12:32.187 --> 00:12:35.887
You wanted me in order
to control Hokuto's power?!

00:12:36.697 --> 00:12:39.097
We no longer need you.

00:12:47.807 --> 00:12:50.297
I'm your enemy!

00:12:52.437 --> 00:12:55.977
Death... Death...

00:12:55.977 --> 00:12:58.967
Humans die without fail.

00:13:00.447 --> 00:13:03.987
Even if we could kill Shikabane,
who go against our philosophy,

00:13:03.987 --> 00:13:08.647
no one can defeat death itself!

00:13:22.467 --> 00:13:27.007
So I can't... defeat her?

00:13:27.007 --> 00:13:28.337
I can't, either?

00:13:30.617 --> 00:13:33.017
I'm sorry...

00:13:33.017 --> 00:13:35.007
Keisei...

00:13:36.147 --> 00:13:38.817
I thought I told you not to come near her.

00:13:38.817 --> 00:13:41.687
You said you'd set all
the Shikabane Hime free.

00:13:41.687 --> 00:13:45.527
It'd better not be a lie.

00:14:09.187 --> 00:14:10.377
Ouri...

00:14:18.357 --> 00:14:19.557
Ouri!

00:14:33.977 --> 00:14:36.877
Can't be! No one can surpass death!

00:14:36.877 --> 00:14:39.537
When all the regrets must've been cut off!

00:14:40.517 --> 00:14:43.887
I've still got a reason to fight.

00:14:43.887 --> 00:14:47.547
There's someone who's crying out for me!

00:14:54.097 --> 00:14:57.037
So this is the base of the Seven Stars, huh?

00:14:57.037 --> 00:14:58.497
Kougon Sect!

00:14:58.497 --> 00:15:00.337
There's so many!

00:15:00.337 --> 00:15:03.167
We'll take back that Shikabane Hime!

00:15:03.167 --> 00:15:06.167
Also, we'll wipe out the Seven Stars, too!

00:15:08.607 --> 00:15:09.877
Wait!

00:15:09.877 --> 00:15:13.247
Don't worry!
We've blocked off their escape.

00:15:13.247 --> 00:15:15.447
You guys made me a decoy to find them!

00:15:15.447 --> 00:15:19.517
I didn't know it, either.
Leave things here to us. Go...

00:15:19.517 --> 00:15:21.587
Ouri... Geez...

00:15:21.587 --> 00:15:25.587
I know it's a Shikabane Hime's job,
but he's such a pain!

00:15:33.467 --> 00:15:38.437
Something more important than
your regret about the Seven Stars...

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:40.407
Whoa! Where're you going?!

00:15:40.407 --> 00:15:42.897
Could it be... a date?!

00:15:44.647 --> 00:15:47.307
Everyone... be careful...

00:15:52.117 --> 00:15:54.887
Ouri... Ouri...

00:15:54.887 --> 00:15:57.297
Ahh... This is Ouri's body.

00:15:57.297 --> 00:16:02.127
You've become a
Shikabane after all... just like us...

00:16:02.127 --> 00:16:04.117
Now, eat, Ouri!

00:16:15.347 --> 00:16:17.007
I...

00:16:27.957 --> 00:16:31.617
Ouri! Ouri! Where are you going?! Ouri!

00:16:34.797 --> 00:16:39.467
You fool! You're a Shikabane!
There's no point in doing that!

00:16:39.467 --> 00:16:42.437
Ouri... So you're really...

00:16:42.437 --> 00:16:45.107
Eat me.

00:16:45.107 --> 00:16:48.147
I don't know what to do.

00:16:48.147 --> 00:16:50.377
I...

00:16:50.377 --> 00:16:56.287
I... just wanted...
mom to pay attention to me.

00:16:56.287 --> 00:16:57.617
Ouri...

00:16:57.617 --> 00:17:01.327
Please... There's nothing else I can do.

00:17:01.327 --> 00:17:05.317
Okay. Then I'll take your body.

00:17:06.967 --> 00:17:09.967
That's right! You're a Shikabane!

00:17:09.967 --> 00:17:11.827
Eat those brats!

00:17:13.297 --> 00:17:15.367
You bastard!

00:17:15.367 --> 00:17:19.077
I will... We will protect Ouri!

00:17:19.077 --> 00:17:19.977
What'd you say?!

00:17:19.977 --> 00:17:22.677
We've been together with Ouri.

00:17:22.677 --> 00:17:26.177
Whether he'd become
a human or a Shikabane...

00:17:26.177 --> 00:17:27.647
we've been watching all this time.

00:17:27.647 --> 00:17:29.817
Don't you detest Ouri?!

00:17:29.817 --> 00:17:32.557
We died because of him!

00:17:32.557 --> 00:17:34.757
We are brothers.

00:17:34.757 --> 00:17:40.167
Ouri and we were crying because
we wanted to be loved. That's all.

00:17:40.167 --> 00:17:41.667
Your regret, too, is...

00:17:41.667 --> 00:17:44.597
My regret is about eating!

00:17:44.597 --> 00:17:48.157
Okay, then. I'll eat you, too!

00:17:51.077 --> 00:17:53.607
You are... a Shikabane!

00:17:53.607 --> 00:17:55.767
Die as a Shikabane!

00:18:00.787 --> 00:18:03.447
Ouri! Ouri!

00:18:03.447 --> 00:18:11.127
I was born of a Shikabane...
Will I die as a Shikabane?

00:18:11.127 --> 00:18:13.697
You look terrible.

00:18:13.697 --> 00:18:16.027
Shikabane Hime!

00:18:24.107 --> 00:18:25.437
Makina...

00:18:25.437 --> 00:18:28.147
Is that your true form?

00:18:28.147 --> 00:18:32.747
I don't know. What am I?
A human? A Shikabane?

00:18:32.747 --> 00:18:35.117
Then, I'll show you!

00:18:53.397 --> 00:18:55.567
Don't forget, Ouri.
You're my contracted monk!

00:18:55.567 --> 00:18:58.637
Engrave it beautifully,
Don't forget, Ouri.
You're my contracted monk!

00:18:58.637 --> 00:19:00.277
Engrave it beautifully,
No!

00:19:00.277 --> 00:19:01.447
Engrave it beautifully,
You are a beast!
Remember, you are a Shikabane!

00:19:01.447 --> 00:19:04.977
The peaceful place that fades
in and out like a dream
You are a beast!
Remember, you are a Shikabane!

00:19:04.977 --> 00:19:07.287
The peaceful place that fades
in and out like a dream
I'm alive!
I'm neither a beast nor a Shikabane!

00:19:07.287 --> 00:19:08.947
I'm alive!
I'm neither a beast nor a Shikabane!

00:19:08.947 --> 00:19:09.487
I'm one of the living!

00:19:09.487 --> 00:19:10.757
I shout... I grant...
I'm one of the living!

00:19:10.757 --> 00:19:12.657
I shout... I grant...
Seven Stars! I'll destroy you!

00:19:12.657 --> 00:19:15.427
I shout... I grant...
I must be the same as you are!

00:19:15.427 --> 00:19:15.787
And I head past the unwavering obsessions
I must be the same as you are!

00:19:15.787 --> 00:19:18.697
And I head past the unwavering obsessions
You and I should be the same!

00:19:18.697 --> 00:19:22.097
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:19:22.097 --> 00:19:27.707
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:19:27.707 --> 00:19:32.777
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:19:32.777 --> 00:19:34.947
I destroy... I try...

00:19:34.947 --> 00:19:38.117
I destroy... I try...
You and I may be the same!

00:19:38.117 --> 00:19:38.677
I destroy... I try...

00:19:38.677 --> 00:19:45.157
I just have to live with all my might

00:19:45.157 --> 00:19:46.387
I don't feel Ioneliness since I left it somewhere

00:19:46.387 --> 00:19:49.687
I don't feel Ioneliness since I left it somewhere
Even so, I will...

00:19:49.687 --> 00:19:50.997
I don't feel Ioneliness since I left it somewhere
live as a human!

00:19:50.997 --> 00:19:51.697
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...
live as a human!

00:19:51.697 --> 00:19:56.127
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:19:56.127 --> 00:20:00.297
Shine the light!

00:20:05.177 --> 00:20:07.637
Mo... m...

00:20:18.887 --> 00:20:21.687
Makina... You're okay...

00:20:21.687 --> 00:20:25.997
What can I say?
No one came to rescue me.

00:20:25.997 --> 00:20:27.567
So I came back alone.

00:20:27.567 --> 00:20:29.867
Ah... Sorry...

00:20:29.867 --> 00:20:31.937
Just kidding.

00:20:31.937 --> 00:20:36.497
More importantly, don't try
to die without my permission...

00:20:37.277 --> 00:20:38.707
since...

00:20:39.737 --> 00:20:41.737
I need you.

00:20:43.107 --> 00:20:44.597
Okay.

00:20:46.447 --> 00:20:47.437
Ouri!

00:20:48.417 --> 00:20:49.947
Ah!

00:20:49.947 --> 00:20:52.117
Something's wrong! It's flying too low!

00:20:55.957 --> 00:20:58.617
Seven Stars! This is the end for you!

00:21:01.797 --> 00:21:03.627
This is the beginning!

00:21:03.627 --> 00:21:04.967
It's gonna crash!

00:21:09.637 --> 00:21:11.037
In lkai City?

00:21:11.037 --> 00:21:14.277
Yes. And ten minutes later,
two commercial flights...

00:21:14.277 --> 00:21:18.377
50,000 people...
no 100,000 people could be dead.

00:21:18.377 --> 00:21:21.447
Even if just a small fraction
of victims become Shikabane,

00:21:21.447 --> 00:21:24.617
the number will exceed several hundred!

00:21:24.617 --> 00:21:27.817
This is the Seven Stars' doing?

00:21:33.797 --> 00:21:36.167
It has already begun!

00:21:36.167 --> 00:21:38.157
The grand defilement!

00:21:55.587 --> 00:22:02.827
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:02.827 --> 00:22:06.857
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:06.857 --> 00:22:14.537
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:14.537 --> 00:22:22.467
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:25.177 --> 00:22:30.987
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:30.987 --> 00:22:36.887
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:36.887 --> 00:22:42.727
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:42.727 --> 00:22:48.537
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:48.537 --> 00:22:53.637
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:53.637 --> 00:23:01.387
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:01.387 --> 00:23:05.417
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:05.417 --> 00:23:13.097
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:13.097 --> 00:23:20.997
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:26.237 --> 00:23:32.547
What lies beyond the darkness is
perhaps a truth that is cruel to all.

00:23:32.547 --> 00:23:36.047
And yet if you still say you
can't help finding it out,

00:23:36.047 --> 00:23:40.107
then let's go,
"to the other side of Hell."
